<!--pages/recycle/recycle.wxml — 删除的记忆：编辑(回编辑卡可存为冰山) / 删除(彻底清除)-->
<view class="page wash-bg">
  <view class="head">
    <text class="title">删除的记忆</text>
    <text class="sub">在这里放 5 天；编辑后可重新变成冰山，删除则彻底清除</text>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{!items.length && !loading}}" class="empty">
    <text class="empty-title">这里空空的</text>
    <text class="empty-sub">您说的每一座冰山，都好好漂在海面上</text>
    <button class="btn-primary empty-btn" hover-class="btn-hover" hover-stay-time="80"
      bindtap="goOcean">回海洋看看</button>
  </view>

  <scroll-view scroll-y class="list" wx:if="{{items.length}}" enhanced show-scrollbar="{{false}}">
    <view class="cloud-card enter" style="animation-delay:{{(index > 5 ? 5 : index) * 50}}ms"
      wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="_id">
      <view class="cloud-top">
        <view class="cloud-info">
          <text class="cloud-title">{{item.title || '一段回忆'}}</text>
          <text class="cloud-meta">{{item.zoneName}}之海 · {{item.daysLeft}}天后清除</text>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="cloud-btns">
        <button class="btn-ghost flex1" hover-class="btn-hover" hover-stay-time="80"
          data-id="{{item._id}}" bindtap="editCloud">编辑</button>
        <button class="btn-danger-ghost flex1" hover-class="btn-hover" hover-stay-time="80"
          data-id="{{item._id}}" bindtap="purgeCloud">删除</button>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="list-tip">
      <text>点"编辑"回到卡片，可直接存为冰山</text>
    </view>
  </scroll-view>
</view>
<privacy-popup />
